# Project Governance Rules
- Monorepo using `pnpm` workspaces: `apps/web` (Next.js), `apps/api` (NestJS), `packages/shared`.
- All monetary amounts in Nepalese Rupees (NPR) must use integers (paisa) or Prisma Decimal.
- Any change to shared contracts must be coordinated through `packages/shared`.
- Follow strict approval boundaries outlined in root `AGENTS.md`.
